# adws/adw_modules/ is VENDORED. It is stamped by `/sssf install` and belongs to
# the skill, not to the repo it lands in. Editing a file here is a fork: the next
# install will not merge your change, and `/sssf install --check` will report the
# file as drifted.
#
# Customise by DATA instead:
#   commands        -> the `quality:` block in sssf.config.yaml
#   models/agents   -> the `agents:` block
#   prompts         -> adws/adw_data/prompt_engineering/ (already per-repo)
#   new workflows   -> new adws/adw_*.py files, which are yours
